      drill:
        "Write out three common fear-based rapture arguments in formal logical structure, identifying where the appeal to fear occurs and where circular reasoning compounds it. For each one, write a calm, evidence-based response that redirects the conversation from emotion to Scripture. Practice using phrases like: 'That is an important concern, and I understand why it feels urgent. But let us look at what the text actually says...'",
